The captured @nestjs/observe 0.1.8 SDK documents createObserveModule, serviceId, forwardLogs, redaction keys, and trace correlation. Its documentation says hosted log forwarding needs Pro or above. It does not retain an OTLP or self-hosted ingestion endpoint. This is an evidence gap, not a claim that such products do not exist.

