The peer package.json files configure Nest examples only. This vote selects no external Jet library, new command, production default, or remote disclosure.

The candidate bind consumes one checked App, validates the named public operations, and returns the same App with a protocol listener registration.

The existing App lifetime starts and stops that listener. A binding mismatch must reject before listening. There is no second application operation registry.

Binding and stream semantics remain owed under the separate semantic card. No placement can claim those semantics are already shipped.

D-DX-SERVERFN1=A and D-ENDPOINT-SHAPE1=A remain binding. Preserve typed public input, success, failure, capability, cancellation, and middleware facts.

