decisions.detail:
Propose jet.report/v3 with cause entries containing stable code and known file/line/col/span.

Preserve nearest-first order and repeated codes.

Unknown fields remain null; never inherit the root location.

One internal cause record supplies canonical rendering and LSP relatedInformation.

LSP requires a real resource and range: unknown locations remain in structured or non-navigable text, not fake URIs or0:0 positions.

Internal origin carriage is BIG-F08; this ballot does not postpone existing editor-law repairs.

If A is chosen, cut over canonical producers/consumers consistently, without a second mutable cause list or deprecated wire alias.

B preserves the current canonical shape and obtains location detail through existing internal/editor paths; those existing paths still require their own fidelity proof.

The separate compiler-facade origin/version choice is not silently coupled to this canonical report version.

